# ⚙️ 70. STATE PROCESSING ORDER

To avoid inconsistent states, the Game State System should process changes in a controlled order.

Recommended:

```text
1. Input
2. Validate Request
3. Identify Entities
4. Read Current State
5. Apply System Logic
6. Calculate Consequences
7. Update States
8. Process Gold Transactions when required
9. Validate New State
10. Generate Event
11. Save Persistent State
```

