# 🪙 73. GOLD TRANSACTION RULES

All Gold changes must be processed through a validated transaction.

Gold can be:

```text
Earned
Spent
Rewarded
Lost
Transferred
Consumed
```

For a Master Level upgrade:

```text
Gold Before
      ↓
Upgrade Cost Validation
      ↓
Gold Deduction
      ↓
Master Level Increase
      ↓
Gold After
```

The transaction must be atomic.

If the Master Level update fails:

```text
Gold must not be deducted.
```

If Gold is deducted successfully but the level update fails:

```text
The transaction must be rolled back.
```

