# ⚠️ 78. STATE CONSISTENCY

The system must prevent impossible conditions.

Invalid:

```text
Floor 20 = CLEARED
Floor 19 = LOCKED
```

if Floor 20 requires Floor 19.

Invalid:

```text
Master Level = 20
Gold = -500
```

unless negative Gold is explicitly allowed.

Invalid:

```text
Master Level increases
Gold remains unchanged
```

when the upgrade requires Gold.

Invalid:

```text
Master Level = 20
Master EXP = 5000
```

because the Master does not use EXP.

Invalid:

```text
Character Status = DEAD
Character HP = 100%
```

unless the game explicitly allows such a state.

Invalid:

```text
Quest = COMPLETED
Objective = INCOMPLETE
```

unless the quest configuration allows alternative completion.

