# 🧠 95. DESIGN PHILOSOPHY

The Game State System should remain:

```text
Modular
Persistent
Deterministic where required
Configurable
Observable
Validated
Extensible
```

The system should not contain every gameplay rule.

Instead:

> **It provides the infrastructure through which gameplay systems modify the world safely.**

Master progression must remain simple and deterministic:

```text
Gold
      ↓
Master Level Upgrade
      ↓
Master Level
```

No Master EXP system is required.

