# 🌑 98. FINAL PHILOSOPHY

> **The Game State System is the heart of Aetheria's living world.**

The Core World Building defines:

> **What Aetheria is.**

The Game Manager defines:

> **How systems operate.**

The Time System defines:

> **When things happen.**

The RNG System defines:

> **What random result occurs.**

The AI System defines:

> **What decisions can be recommended or simulated.**

The ID System defines:

> **Which entity is involved.**

The Database System defines:

> **What information is permanently remembered.**

The Tower System defines:

> **Which floors have been completed.**

The Master Level System defines:

> **How the Master increases Level by spending Gold.**

The Game State System defines:

> **What the world is like right now and how it changes.**

The Master does not use EXP.

The Master Level increases only through a successful Gold-based upgrade.

Therefore:

```text
                    AETHERIA
                       │
                       ▼
                 WORLD DEFINITION
                       │
                       ▼
                  GAME MANAGER
                       │
                       ▼
               GAME STATE SYSTEM
                       │
            ┌──────────┼──────────┐
            │          │          │
           TIME       RNG        AI
            │          │          │
            └──────────┼──────────┘
                       ▼
                  STATE CHANGE
                       │
                       ▼
                  GOLD TRANSACTION
                       │
                       ▼
              MASTER LEVEL UPGRADE
                       │
                       ▼
                  CONSEQUENCE
                       │
                       ▼
                  WORLD EVOLUTION
                       │
                       ▼
                   ID SYSTEM
                       │
                       ▼
